 a dynamic team creating world-class international experiences for students. Build meaningful partnerships and deliver programs that broaden horizons. Engineer, Google Cloud Flexible 16 Sep 2026 Do you have extensive hands-on experience with Google Cloud Platform (GCP) and other Google Services? \nDrive cloud innovation and service excellence, shaping reliable, high-performing services that transforms the cloud experiences across the University. Senior Adviser, Student Success (Progress) Flexible, Geelong - City, Melbourne - Burwood 15 Sep 2026 Help drive positive student outcomes by providing expert advice and support on academic progress matters that make a meaningful difference to student success. Digital Content Writer Flexible, Geelong - City, Melbourne - Burwood 14 Sep 2026 The Digital Content Writer creates compelling, audience-focused content that brings Deakin’s brand to life across its website and multi-channel marketing campaigns. As part of the Platforms and Experience team within the Marketing & Recruitment division, this role develops content strategies that connect with diverse external audiences, crafting clear and persuasive content informed by audience needs, brand standards, SEO and digital best-practice. Senior Officer, Student Success (Outcomes) Flexible, Geelong - City, Melbourne - Burwood 13 Sep 2026 Make a lasting impact on student success by delivering timely support and initiatives that help every student thrive. Counsellor Melbourne - Burwood 13 Sep 2026 Join our team as a Counsellor and make a real impact by delivering evidence based mental health support, inclusive counselling and short-term interventions that help students thrive both personally and academically. Senior Manager, Individual and Community Giving Melbourne - Burwood 13 Sep 2026 Ready to make a lasting impact? Join Deakin as Senior Manager, Individual & Community Giving and lead innovative fundraising campaigns that inspire giving, grow donor communities and deliver sustain