 strong partnerships. Lead, Financial Accounting Melbourne - Burwood 21 Sep 2026 Provide expert accounting leadership and operational support across the University, its controlled entities and international campuses, ensuring compliance with accounting standards, legislation and organisational policies. Coordinator, Foreign Engagement Compliance Flexible 20 Sep 2026 Lead the coordination of foreign engagement compliance, including due diligence and risk management, while providing advice and training to staff on regulatory obligations. Coordinator, International Student Experience Flexible, Geelong - City, Geelong - Waurn Ponds, Melbourne - Burwood 20 Sep 2026 Join a dynamic team creating world-class international experiences for students. Build meaningful partnerships and deliver programs that broaden horizons. Engineer, Google Cloud Flexible 16 Sep 2026 Do you have extensive hands-on experience with Google Cloud Platform (GCP) and other Google Services? \nDrive cloud innovation and service excellence, shaping reliable, high-performing services that transforms the cloud experiences across the University. Senior Adviser, Student Success (Progress) Flexible, Geelong - City, Melbourne - Burwood 15 Sep 2026 Help drive positive student outcomes by providing expert advice and support on academic progress matters that make a meaningful difference to student success. Digital Content Writer Flexible, Geelong - City, Melbourne - Burwood 14 Sep 2026 The Digital Content Writer creates compelling, audience-focused content that brings Deakin’s brand to life across its website and multi-channel marketing campaigns. As part of the Platforms and Experience team within the Marketing & Recruitment division, this role develops content strategies that connect with diverse external audiences, crafting clear and persuasive content informed by audience needs, brand standards, SEO and digital best-practice. Senior Officer, Student Success (Outcomes) Flexible, Geelong - City, Melbourne - Burwood 13 Sep 2026 Make a lasting impact on student success by delivering timely support and initiatives that help every student thrive. Counsellor Melbourne - Burwood 13 Sep 2026 Join our team as a Counsellor and make a real impact by delivering evidence based mental health support, inclusive counselling and short-term interventions that help students thrive both personally and academically. Senior Manager, Individual and Community Giving Melbourne - Burwood 13 Sep 2026 Ready to make a lasting impact? Join Deakin as Senior Manager, Individual & Community Giving and lead innovative fundraising campaigns that inspire giving, grow donor communities and deliver sustainable philanthropic growth. Using data, strategy and creativity, you'll strengthen donor relationships, build long-term supporter value and help unlock the future of philanthropy at Deakin. Communications Lead Geelong - City, Melbourne - Burwood 11 Sep 2026 Craft executive messaging and amplify stories that strengthen the reputation and impact of Deakin University. Senior Integration Developer Flexible 13 Sep 2026 Lead the delivery of secure, scalable MuleSoft integration solutions and make a University-wide impact. Adviser, Safer Community Geelong - City, Geelong - Waurn Ponds 10 Sep 2026 Make a real difference by helping create a safe, respectful and supportive university community. In this rewarding role, you'll provide specialist guidance and support while leading initiatives that promote wellbeing, safety and inclusion across campus. Marketing Manager, Faculty Marketing Flexible, Geelong - City, Melbourne - Burwood 13 Sep 2026 Lead, influence and inspire as one of our next two Marketing Managers, partnering with a faculty and guiding a high-performing team to deliver innovative marketing strategies and impactful campaigns. We have two exciting opportunities available: a 16-month contract supporting the Faculty of Science, Engineering and Built Environment (SEBE), and a permanent role supporting the Faculty of Business and Law. In these key leadership roles, you’ll  build strong stakeholder relationships, provide strategic marketing advice and help shape initiatives that support the faculty to meet their student load targets. Offering genuine variety and impact, no two days will be the same. Senior Manager, Research Platforms Geelong - City, Geelong - Waurn Ponds, Melbourne - Burwood, Melbourne - City 10 Sep 2026 The Senior Manager, Research Platforms is a strategic technology leader who drives innovation, enterprise capability and effective governance to transform Deakin’s research operations, enable the end-to-end research lifecycle and deliver an exceptional experience for researchers and research support staff. Current opportunities Position Location Closes Coordinator, Primary Prevention Geelong - City, Melbourne - Burwood, Flexible 22 Sep 2026 Join Deakin's Equity & Inclusion team and help shape a safer, more respectful future through prevention and education. Senior People & Culture Partner Geelong - City, Geelong - Waurn Ponds, Melbourne - Burwood 22 Sep 2026 Are you a confident, agile senior HR professional ready to make an impact? Join Deakin as a Senior People and Culture Partner, shaping innovative people strategies, driving talent initiatives and delivering customer-focused solutions through strong partnerships. Lead, Financial Accounting Melbourne - Burwood 21 Sep 2026 Provide expert accounting leadership and operational support across the University, its controlled entities and international campuses, ensuring compliance with accounting standards, legislation and organisational policies. Coordinator, Foreign Engagement Compliance Flexible 20 Sep 2026 Lead the coordination of foreign engagement compliance, including due diligence and risk management, while providing advice and training to staff on regulatory obligations. Coordinator, International Student Experience Flexible, Geelong - City, Geelong - Waurn Ponds, Melbourne - Burwood 20 Sep 2026 Join